   "text": "\"the gateway intermediate exchange ALWAYS uses the verified\nsupervisor SVID subject as its audience\", and audience_overrides\n\"do not affect the gateway intermediate exchange\".\n\nSo hop 3's subject token carries aud = a spiffe:// URI. If Keycloak\nstill demands the requesting client be in aud, the AGENT client's\nclientId may have to BE that SPIFFE ID \u2014 which moves azp off\na friendly name and makes the policy value tenant-specific.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "\"the gateway intermediate exchange ALWAYS uses the verified\nsupervisor SVID subject as its audience\", and audience_overrides\n\"do not affect the gateway intermediate exchange\".\n\nSo hop 3's subject token carries aud = a spiffe:// URI. If Keycloak\nstill demands the requesting client be in aud, the AGENT client's\nclientId may have to BE that SPIFFE ID \u2014 which moves azp off\na friendly name and makes the policy value tenant-specific.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
